# frames 300 every 10 from 200
# A death and its card (pk02; re-timed by pk03's curve): seed 16 from row
# 600 with health taken to zero at tick 1 (the alpha alone from tick 5,
# the four others fainted where they stood), so the first landed attack
# ends the run. The card is drawn over the field from the same cell model
# on both tiers: shadows vanquished, seconds survived, the distance in
# cells (from row 600), the score, the offer (s saves, q leaves). The
# world stands still under it; the first numbers the player sees are the
# card's.
pk 1
seed 16
tier rich
size 80x24
start 600
t 1 health -100
